    "story_en": "Kaikeyi asked for two boons. Rama went to the forest for 14 years. Sita and Lakshmana went with him.",
    "moral_ta": "கடமையை மகிழ்ச்சியுடன் செய்.",
    "moral_en": "Do duty with joy.",
